</section>

<!-- ═══════════════ ABOUT PAGE ═══════════════ -->
<section class="page" id="page-about">
  <div class="about-hero">
    <h1>ABOUT</h1>
  </div>
  <div class="about-content">
    <h2 class="sec-title">Our Story</h2>
    <div class="sec-line"></div>
    <p>Founded in 2018, Maison was born from a shared belief that clothing should be more than fabric — it should be a quiet expression of who you are. Every piece in our collection is thoughtfully sourced and designed with intention.</p>
    <p>We work exclusively with sustainable ateliers across Europe and Asia, ensuring that the hands that craft your garments are treated with dignity and care. Quality is not a feature — it is our foundation.</p>
    <p>From the first stitch to the final detail, Maison is crafted for those who value the enduring over the ephemeral.</p>

    <div class="about-values">
      <div class="value-card">
        <div class="icon">🌿</div>
        <h4>Sustainable</h4>
        <p>Ethically sourced materials and fair-trade partnerships at every level.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="value-card">
        <div class="icon">✦</div>
        <h4>Handcrafted</h4>
        <p>Each garment is made by skilled artisans with meticulous attention.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="value-card">
        <div class="icon">∞</div>
        <h4>Timeless</h4>
        <p>Designs that transcend seasons and stay elegant year after year.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
